### DECOUPLE
- **Raw Data Entities and Their Relationships:**
  - Product Name: AeroSound Nova Pro
  - Product Image: Matte Black Headphones
  - Product Category: Studio Reference Series
  - Price: $349.00 USD
  - Description: Precision-engineered acoustic planar drivers delivering uncompromising spatial clarity, 42-hour battery life, and military-grade adaptive noise cancellation.
  - Specifications:
    - Frequency Response: 5Hz - 48,000Hz
    - Driver Size: 50mm Custom Beryllium
    - Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4 Ultra-Low Latency / Lossless USB-C
    - Battery Life: 42h with ANC active
  - Call to Action: Add to Cart & Express Checkout

- **User Goals and Interactions:**
  - View product details and specifications.
  - Add product to cart.
  - Express checkout.

- **Information Hierarchy:**
  - Product Name (most important)
  - Price (second most important)
  - Description (third most important)
  - Specifications (fourth most important)
  - Call to Action (least important)

- **Functional Requirements:**
  - Display product image.
  - Display product name and category.
  - Display price.
  - Display description.
  - Display specifications.
  - Add to cart button.

### BANNED
- 🚫 Sidebar + Topbar + Content layout
- 🚫 Centered hero + section stacking
- 🚫 Standard navbar with logo-links-CTA
- 🚫 Linear page scrolling with repeated section blocks
- 🚫 Flexbox-based layout with text-align: center

### CONCEPTUALIZE
Using a **magazine asymmetry** spatial metaphor, we will create a layout that is visually interesting and unconventional.

```
+--------------------------------+
|                               |
|           Magazine Cover      |
|                               |
+----------------+-------------+
|     Product    |       Info  |
|     Image      |       Panel |
+----------------+-------------+
|   Description  |   Features  |
+----------------+-------------+
|    Add to Cart |  Price      |
|     Button     |             |
+----------------+-------------+
```

### EXECUTE
Here is the complete, self-contained HTML+CSS design following the Deanchor protocol.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>AeroSound Nova Pro Wireless Headphones</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
      background: #2c3e50;
      color: white;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
    }
    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 800px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 3fr;
      grid-gap: 20px;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(34, 193, 195, 0.9);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }
    .cover {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }
    .cover img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }
    .cover:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
    .info {
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .title {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin: 10px 0;
    }
    .price {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #f39c12;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }
    .price:hover {
      transform: scale(1.1);
    }
    .desc {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    .features {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .features li {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .btn {
      background: #2c3e50;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      transform: scale(1.1);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cover">
      <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/350x150" alt="Matte Black Headphones">
    </div>
    <div class="info">
      <div class="title">AeroSound Nova Pro</div>
      <div class="price">$349.00 USD</div>
      <div class="desc">
        Precision-engineered acoustic planar drivers delivering uncompromising spatial clarity, 42-hour battery life, and military-grade adaptive noise cancellation.
      </div>
      <ul class="features">
        <li><strong>Frequency Response:</strong> 5Hz - 48,000Hz</li>
        <li><strong>Driver Size:</strong> 50mm Custom Beryllium</li>
        <li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Bluetooth 5.4 Ultra-Low Latency / Lossless USB-C</li>
        <li><strong>Battery Life:</strong> 42h with ANC active</li>
      </ul>
      <button class="btn">Add to Cart &bull; Express Checkout</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
```

This design breaks every item on the banned list and uses a magazine asymmetry spatial metaphor. The layout is visually engaging, and the animations enhance the user experience.

### DECOUPLED ELEMENTS:
1. **Raw Data Entities and their Relationships:**
   - Total Portfolio Net Worth: $142,890.45
   - Asset Cards: Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Solana (SOL) with respective amounts and fiat values
   - Transactions: Recent ledger activity with details and amounts

2. **User Goals and Interactions:**
   - Display portfolio summary
   - Display assets with their values
   - Display recent transactions

3. **Information Hierarchy:**
   - Total Portfolio Net Worth (most important)
   - Asset Cards (second most important)
   - Transactions (least important)

4. **Functional Requirements:**
   - Display all the above data
   - Optionally, allow interaction (e.g., clicking on asset cards to view more details)

### BANNED PATTERNS:
- 🚫 Sidebar + Topbar + Content layout
- 🚫 N-column grid of cards
- 🚫 Centered hero + section stacking
- 🚫 Standard navbar with logo-links-CTA
- 🚫 Linear page scrolling with repeated section blocks

### CONCEPTUALIZE:
Design a **Kinetic Type** layout where information flows like a stream of data. The total portfolio net worth will be the central focal point, surrounded by asset cards and recent transactions.

```
----------------------
|    Total Balance    |
----------------------
|   Asset Stream      |
|   |   |   |        |
|BTC  ETH  SOL        |
|   |   |   |        |
----------------------
|   Recent Activity  |
----------------------
```

### EXECUTE:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Apex Vault - Digital Asset Portfolio</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
      background: #0f172a;
      color: #f8fafc;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 30px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .balance {
      font-size: 56px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .stream {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .stream-item {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      width: 150px;
      height: 100px;
      background: #1e293b;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      transform: rotate(-10deg);
      animation: rotate 5s linear infinite;
    }
    .stream-item h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #94a3b8;
    }
    .stream-item .amount {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #38bdf8;
    }
    .stream-item .fiat {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #64748b;
    }
    .activity {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .activity .tx-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
    }
    .activity .tx-row span {
      flex: 1;
    }
    .activity .tx-row .positive {
      color: #4ade80;
    }
    .activity .tx-row .negative {
      color: #f43f5e;
    }
    @keyframes rotate {
      100% {
        transform: rotate(360deg);
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="balance">
    $142,890.45
  </div>
  <div class="stream">
    <div class="stream-item">
      <h3>Bitcoin (BTC)</h3>
      <div class="amount">1.8420</div>
      <div class="fiat">&asymp; $98,420.00 (68.8%)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stream-item">
      <h3>Ethereum (ETH)</h3>
      <div class="amount">12.5000</div>
      <div class="fiat">&asymp; $32,150.00 (22.5%)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stream-item">
      <h3>Solana (SOL)</h3>
      <div class="amount">85.0000</div>
      <div class="fiat">&asymp; $12,320.45 (8.6%)</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="activity">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Recent Ledger Activity</h3>
    <div class="tx-row">
      <span>Bought 0.05 BTC</span>
      <span class="positive">+$2,650.00</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tx-row">
      <span>Staked 4.00 ETH</span>
      <span class="positive">Earn 4.2% APY</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tx-row">
      <span>Transferred 15.0 SOL to Cold Wallet</span>
      <span class="negative">-$2,175.00</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
```

This design uses a kinetic type layout where the asset cards rotate infinitely, breaking away from the conventional grid layout. The recent activity is displayed in a stream-like format, ensuring a dynamic and engaging user experience.
